Timeout Protection
import signal

def timeout_handler(signum, frame):
    raise TimeoutError()

signal.signal(signal.SIGALRM, timeout_handler)
signal.alarm(5)


Prevents scripts from hanging forever.

DevOps Insight

Reliable automation is not about success paths — it’s about handling failures correctly.
